      "writtenOn": "2024-04-29T20:00:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this is a good reason to make it a GKI module. See https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/convert-or-add for details. If you have issues, reach out to @ramjiyani@google.com",
