      "writtenOn": "2024-04-29T22:00:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi: @tkjos@google.com \n\nThis is `13-5.15` where we don\u0027t have the tooling for GKI module symbol protection on this kernel and only GKI modules on these kernel are `zram` and `zsmalloc` which are unprotected. We can have this as a unprotected module but better to have it in GKI if it\u0027s not an issue.\n\nWe can add this as protected GKI module for `android14+` if required.",
      "parentUuid": "f492f6de_48400eb3",
      "revId": "479c72555648814c26a6160b47cd5c3262ee006c",
